                                                "sense_id": "3c9c11de-4b6f-3ed7-9c32-e583f69bd5e0",
                                                "text": "Their closest living relatives, deer mice, dwell in forests instead of open spaces, she learned, and they live promiscuously instead of monogamously."
                                            }
